# Cloudflare Pages auto-serves /access.html at /access — no manual rewrites needed.
# (Previous rules caused a 308 redirect loop on /access, /quiz, /bonus.)

# Book-printed portal URLs → the universal access page. Some interiors print a
# book-specific path (e.g. the CAP book says /cap, the CEN book says /cen-access)
# that has no page of its own; send those to /access so the printed link works.
/cap          /access?book=cap    302
/cen-access   /access?book=cen    302
/sat-access    /access?book=sat-math   302
/sat-resources /access?book=sat-math   302
/psat-access    /access?book=psat-math   302
/psat-resources /access?book=psat-math   302
